# IP Address Segmentation

IP segmentation means dividing a large network into smaller networks.

Example:

VNet:
10.0.0.0/16

Segmented into:
10.0.1.0/24
10.0.2.0/24
10.0.3.0/24

Benefits:
- Security
- Isolation
- Traffic control
- Better management
- Scalability

