# Layer 4 vs Layer 7

## Layer 4
Works on:
- TCP
- UDP
- Ports

Can identify:
- Source IP
- Destination IP
- Port numbers

Cannot see:
- URL
- Headers
- Cookies

Example:
TCP Port 443

Layer 4 Load Balancer:
IP + Port based routing

---

## Layer 7
Works on:
- HTTP
- HTTPS

Can understand:
- URL
- Headers
- Cookies
- Paths

Example:
/api
/admin

Layer 7 Application Gateway can route traffic based on URL path.

Example:
/api → Backend1
/admin → Backend2

